window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A priceless treasure is hidden within the ocean's depths....</p> <p>Sabine barely managed to escape from Akros with her life.</p> <p>But the ocean isn't safe for someone whose power stems from the forests.</p> <p>When their ship is attacked on the high seas and one of Sabine's companions is taken hostage, only an agreement forged by blood and magic may save her friend's life.</p> <p>The pearl of the sea is also the key to the gods' revenge....</p> <p>With the dragon portal failing and the gods' magic threatening to destroy their world, Sabine must choose between following her heart or upholding a sacred oath.</p> <p>The cost of ending a centuries-old feud may be higher than anyone expected.</p> <p>All magic demands a sacrifice–even if it's hers.</p>"; 
